  "bio": "Lily/Alicia is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Nuremberg, Germany, known for her stunning sketch-style tattoos and photorealistic drawings. At the helm of Wild Roses Tattoo studio, she has established a reputation for her exceptional attention to detail and the ability to bring her clients' visions to life with precision and artistry. Whether it's a delicate design or a complex composition, Lily/Alicia's portfolio is a testament to her proficiency and dedication to the craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Nuremberg, Bavaria, Germany"
